==English==

===Etymology===
Multiple origins. Partially from post-Classical {{bor|en|la|emphȳsēma||swelling}}, from {{der|en|grc|ἐμφῡ́σημα}}, from {{m|grc|ἐμφῡσάω|t=to puff up}}. Also borrowed from {{bor|en|frm|emphysema}}, from the same Latin source; compare {{cog|fr|emphysème}}. Attested from the late 16th century.<ref>{{R:OED Online|emphysema|n|61322|March 2014}}</ref>
{{wikipedia}}

